{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026JsbaaeS0QX1793155964.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地PCB印刷電路板生產商東山精密首日掛牌，股價「潛水」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.RVO.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026GWKS9kcarg1793155961.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>開報82.4元，較招股價86.8元低約半成。以每手100股，不計手續費，一手帳面蝕440元。股份公開發售部分認購不足，一手中籤率百分之100，國際發售則超額認購約2倍。</p><p></p><p>集資淨額逾97億元，用於建設新設施及升級現有設施和生產線等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:07.178241+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T13:18:21.942571+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:38:19.705501+00:00","content_hash":"c330a1738c854191ff869f6776d9fd71da4c665a14d4e78975ff3695250c71fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:07.178241+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}